# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Legacy pages, deliberately not formatted yet.
#
# DECISIONS.md ADR-007 / ADR-009: gates are graduated and the existing 14 pages
# are frozen. Reformatting them all at once would be a several-thousand-line
# diff across the most fragile code in the repo (the homepage scroll pipeline
# especially) with no behavioural benefit and real risk in the CSS and HTML.
#
# HOW TO OPT A FILE IN: delete its line here, run `npm run format`, and review
# the diff on its own — one file, one PR. Do it when you're already touching
# the file for another reason, not as a separate cleanup.
#
# New code is NOT listed here and is formatted from day one: src/shared/,
# src/proto/, scripts/, src/tokens.ts, config files, and all docs.
#
# These paths gained their src/ prefix when the source tree moved. The prefix is
# load-bearing: an entry that no longer matches silently un-freezes the file, and
# the next `npm run format` reformats thousands of lines of the most fragile code
# in the repo. `vite.config.js` keeps no prefix — it stays at the repo root.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

src/index.html
src/index.css
src/script.js
src/tailwind.css
vite.config.js

src/about-me/
src/space-bar/
